WEBVTT

00:08.990 --> 00:16.700
[Ori]

00:17.730 --> 00:18.680
[Ori]

00:19.880 --> 00:20.650
[Ori]

00:38.160 --> 00:39.790
Tomiyama's somethin' else…

01:08.320 --> 01:09.240
Huh?

01:09.870 --> 01:11.390
That's weird…

01:11.980 --> 01:13.970
I thought I was gettin' you good…

01:14.680 --> 01:17.060
Your punches are light.

01:18.860 --> 01:19.520
Huh?

01:20.700 --> 01:22.160
Do you know why that is?

01:28.750 --> 01:30.870
Because there's nothing behind them.

01:33.640 --> 01:35.680
I don't get it at all.

01:36.210 --> 01:39.090
I don't know if they're really light or what, but…

01:41.720 --> 01:44.100
…after long enough, you'll still go down.

01:45.590 --> 01:49.030
I'll keep raining 'em down
until you beg for mercy!

02:04.550 --> 02:05.680
Dude.

02:06.150 --> 02:07.830
I'm telling you…

02:08.330 --> 02:09.810
I don't feel a thing!

02:25.570 --> 02:27.210
Ugh, seriously…

02:28.840 --> 02:30.890
That hurt, man.

02:32.860 --> 02:35.440
I'm gonna claim my freedom.

02:36.310 --> 02:38.030
Don't get in my way!

02:42.840 --> 02:44.920
What does "freedom" mean to you?

02:47.080 --> 02:49.220
It means having fun!

02:51.070 --> 02:55.200
Then what does "fun" mean to you?

02:58.050 --> 03:02.310
Fighting strong guys, like I am. Right now!

03:05.150 --> 03:07.790
You don't look like you're having fun to me.

03:09.560 --> 03:12.160
You don't know anything about yourself.

03:13.000 --> 03:16.310
That's why you're unsatisfied.
Why you focus on what-ifs.

03:17.070 --> 03:18.480
That must be rough.

03:19.510 --> 03:21.390
I pity you.

03:23.120 --> 03:24.710
But not as much as…

03:26.380 --> 03:29.990
I pity your team for having
a guy like that for a leader.

03:31.690 --> 03:34.700
Whatever your reasons, you became top dog, right?

03:36.080 --> 03:36.930
Then…

03:37.560 --> 03:41.280
You shouldn't make anybody make a face like that!

03:46.130 --> 03:49.770
I'm… really glad I came to Furin.

03:50.640 --> 03:53.820
I'm glad he's our leader.

04:01.100 --> 04:03.310
A face like what…?

04:06.200 --> 04:09.190
No, that was a long time ago.

04:18.900 --> 04:20.140
I don't get it…

04:21.730 --> 04:23.980
I don't know. I don't get it!

04:25.680 --> 04:26.860
Shut up…

04:27.260 --> 04:28.340
Shut up.

04:28.790 --> 04:30.160
Shut up!

04:30.540 --> 04:32.500
I don't get it. I don't know.

04:32.710 --> 04:34.720
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

04:36.930 --> 04:41.080
Enough!

04:45.750 --> 04:46.910
Whatever.

04:49.520 --> 04:51.240
I don't need you, either, Ume.

04:54.530 --> 04:56.230
I don't need anything.

06:32.390 --> 06:35.630
When was it that the world turned gray…?

06:37.390 --> 06:39.620
It's dark. Cold.

06:40.820 --> 06:44.470
It's dried out, and nothing I do
changes it. It's so unsatisfying.

06:45.160 --> 06:46.030
It's like…

06:47.930 --> 06:50.330
My heart turned into a desert.

06:52.270 --> 06:53.680
What am I missing?

06:54.380 --> 06:55.950
Why am I missing it?

06:58.270 --> 06:59.460
I don't get it.

07:00.620 --> 07:02.750
Ugh, whatever.

07:03.660 --> 07:05.280
I doubt it matters anymore.

07:06.080 --> 07:08.840
No matter what I do, or what I get,

07:09.290 --> 07:10.930
it won't change a thing.

07:12.090 --> 07:13.800
So I don't need anything.

07:14.710 --> 07:16.320
I don't need a damn thing!

07:22.040 --> 07:24.090
Cho… Choji…

07:42.180 --> 07:44.510
Whoa, is that dude gonna be okay?

07:44.790 --> 07:46.670
Why doesn't he hit back?

07:47.270 --> 07:48.300
Umemiya…

07:49.140 --> 07:50.420
The hell, man?!

07:50.680 --> 07:54.590
You said there was a 100% chance
you'd win, so what the hell?!

07:54.750 --> 07:56.450
H-He's gonna die…

07:57.820 --> 07:58.450
Oi.

07:58.900 --> 08:00.530
Shut up and watch.

08:13.160 --> 08:14.350
Tomiyama…

08:15.810 --> 08:16.780
Sorry.

08:17.400 --> 08:20.700
I didn't mean to back you into a corner.

08:22.040 --> 08:25.430
I didn't know you were that desperate.

08:27.720 --> 08:28.680
Shut up!

08:28.980 --> 08:29.550
But…

08:29.940 --> 08:32.860
If you destroy everything in your despair…

08:33.660 --> 08:35.990
then things will stay rough for you…

08:37.090 --> 08:38.830
forever.

08:38.970 --> 08:41.910
Shut up, shut up, shut arrgh!

08:46.060 --> 08:47.070
Tomiyama.

08:48.880 --> 08:50.000
It's okay.

08:50.730 --> 08:53.230
The answer is inside you.

08:55.830 --> 08:57.910
I-I don't care!

09:00.560 --> 09:02.190
Do you remember…

09:03.210 --> 09:07.090
when Bofurin and Lion's Head went at it?

09:08.240 --> 09:10.830
It turned out it was all a misunderstanding,

09:11.460 --> 09:12.340
yeah?

09:14.040 --> 09:15.070
We're out!

09:17.810 --> 09:20.320
Dude, you're crazy strong.

09:20.380 --> 09:22.590
I got my ass saved again.

09:22.820 --> 09:24.090
Me, too, man!

09:24.550 --> 09:26.910
Thanks, bud! You saved us!

09:28.000 --> 09:30.240
Hearin' that makes it worth it!

09:31.270 --> 09:34.700
Ume, that was the most fun ever!

09:35.140 --> 09:37.170
Let's fight again sometime!

09:38.910 --> 09:42.600
Back then, your punches had weight.

09:42.880 --> 09:44.080
Way more than now.

09:45.750 --> 09:48.400
You were glowing back then.

09:48.940 --> 09:50.600
Way more than now.

09:51.510 --> 09:54.890
Now, what was around you back then?

09:55.840 --> 09:57.990
What did you see?

10:06.210 --> 10:07.960
S-Stay back!

10:26.770 --> 10:27.890
So hot…

10:29.370 --> 10:31.620
Remember, Tomiyama.

10:34.970 --> 10:37.100
What you saw back then…

10:38.000 --> 10:41.820
That's what you need. What the top dog needs.

10:43.500 --> 10:44.500
Thank you.

10:46.310 --> 10:50.430
Remember, Tomiyama!

10:55.030 --> 10:55.940
Huh…?

10:57.340 --> 11:01.800
What's going on? Why do you guys look so happy?

11:07.090 --> 11:08.590
Must be nice…

11:09.290 --> 11:10.910
Let me join in.

11:16.010 --> 11:19.950
[Ori]

11:28.890 --> 11:31.130
Hey, Tomiyama!

11:34.160 --> 11:36.070
What are you doing?

11:36.690 --> 11:38.950
This cat looked like it wanted petting.

11:39.390 --> 11:41.120
You got no discipline.

11:41.430 --> 11:43.860
We're on our way to a fight, dude.

11:44.230 --> 11:47.720
If you wanna be our leader,
you gotta pull yourself together.

11:49.400 --> 11:51.600
Um, speaking of which…

11:52.570 --> 11:54.270
Who were we fighting, again?

11:54.490 --> 11:55.300
Huh?!

12:00.480 --> 12:03.480
Man, you really are destined for greatness, huh?

12:03.540 --> 12:06.610
Yeah, I can't wait to see that! Countin' on ya.

12:06.860 --> 12:09.800
Mhm! Leave it to me! Let's go!

12:09.880 --> 12:12.240
- Lead the way.
- Don't get taken out.

12:12.720 --> 12:14.780
Man, this is so fun.

12:15.120 --> 12:17.250
I hope things stay this fun forever.

12:18.640 --> 12:19.790
Hey, Kame!

12:21.240 --> 12:22.010
Huh…?

12:23.180 --> 12:24.190
Kame?

12:26.510 --> 12:27.510
Arima?

12:28.150 --> 12:29.210
Numa?

12:30.250 --> 12:32.300
Where'd everybody go?

12:57.110 --> 12:58.080
Kame?

13:06.180 --> 13:08.020
Huh? What's going on?

13:09.090 --> 13:11.650
Oh… I must be dreaming.

13:13.700 --> 13:15.120
But it feels kinda…

13:15.930 --> 13:17.490
nostalgic.

13:26.110 --> 13:27.880
Huh? Kame?

13:30.000 --> 13:32.140
Why're you making that face?

13:45.530 --> 13:46.200
Oh.

13:47.480 --> 13:48.090
I…

13:49.000 --> 13:50.810
lost to Ume.

13:53.050 --> 13:58.560
Kame, I… had a dream
from a long time ago.

13:59.590 --> 14:04.400
Everyone was smiling, and I was having
more fun than I've had in a long time.

14:05.630 --> 14:08.230
And I think something clicked.

14:09.280 --> 14:13.300
When everyone else is smiling
and having fun, I have fun, too.

14:14.520 --> 14:16.050
So, y'know…

14:16.910 --> 14:17.590
Smile?

14:23.860 --> 14:25.670
I'm sorry, Choji.

14:27.960 --> 14:30.760
I left you all alone.

14:33.260 --> 14:37.250
None of us knew why you were suffering…

14:38.440 --> 14:40.360
and we still left your side.

14:43.290 --> 14:45.180
Seeing you hurt everyone…

14:47.910 --> 14:49.820
Seeing you hated… I didn't like it.

14:52.080 --> 14:56.100
I couldn't forgive you for shattering my dreams.

14:57.120 --> 14:58.050
Your dreams?

15:07.630 --> 15:11.990
I wanted to see you beloved by everyone.

15:18.150 --> 15:19.360
That's why, that day…

15:20.010 --> 15:21.870
Even though I knew it was wrong…

15:22.280 --> 15:23.390
I looked away.

15:24.660 --> 15:27.200
But I realized a little while ago…

15:27.350 --> 15:30.200
No matter how strong my opponent is,

15:30.310 --> 15:31.890
even if I owe them my life,

15:31.940 --> 15:33.390
I don't look away,

15:33.460 --> 15:35.710
and I don't change!

15:36.540 --> 15:38.290
As a member of Lion's Head…

15:41.430 --> 15:43.000
I needed to confront you.

15:43.810 --> 15:45.590
To make my feelings known.

15:47.150 --> 15:49.290
I'm sorry I didn't talk to you.

15:50.330 --> 15:53.200
I'm sorry I didn't try to
find the answers with you.

15:53.920 --> 15:55.680
I'm sorry I left you alone.

15:56.770 --> 16:01.490
My mistakes ended up taking away
what you needed most.

16:03.300 --> 16:04.020
I'm sorry.

16:05.200 --> 16:07.010
I'm sorry, Choji.

16:10.180 --> 16:11.230
Kame…

16:11.870 --> 16:12.700
Y'know, I…

16:13.470 --> 16:19.030
I believed if I took over, I could
have more fun than anyone.

16:23.110 --> 16:24.000
Let's go!

16:24.740 --> 16:29.620
It was like trying to reach a treasure chest
on top of a mountain. I couldn't wait.

16:30.590 --> 16:32.540
If only I could reach it,

16:32.810 --> 16:34.700
I'd be freer than anyone,

16:34.960 --> 16:37.690
and some super cool stuff would happen.

16:37.910 --> 16:39.000
I was excited.

16:55.240 --> 16:57.610
But, when I finally got there…

16:58.570 --> 17:00.860
it was empty.

17:06.810 --> 17:08.630
I didn't feel anything.

17:17.180 --> 17:18.240
I was scared.

17:20.310 --> 17:22.200
I felt hollow inside.

17:22.870 --> 17:26.020
I didn't know where to go next.

17:27.880 --> 17:30.720
Nothing I did made me feel a thing.

17:31.380 --> 17:33.240
It all felt so empty.

17:34.670 --> 17:39.100
I had to do something. I didn't know
what was wrong. I struggled.

17:39.360 --> 17:41.440
And while I struggled and struggled…

17:42.770 --> 17:44.430
Everything went dark.

17:45.690 --> 17:48.630
And then I blamed it on everyone else.

17:49.610 --> 17:53.500
Because the team as a whole was weak,
I wasn't free, wasn't having fun.

17:54.640 --> 17:59.290
If the team got stronger, everyone would be free.

17:59.980 --> 18:03.380
And then I would finally be able to have fun, too.

18:04.960 --> 18:06.850
You didn't take anything from me.

18:09.230 --> 18:12.120
I was the one who threw it away.

18:13.500 --> 18:14.610
That's right…

18:15.230 --> 18:16.070
I…

18:16.880 --> 18:19.190
I used to laugh my heart out with them.

18:19.630 --> 18:20.990
It was fun.

18:21.910 --> 18:24.220
I had always been free…

18:25.020 --> 18:27.340
But I just couldn't realize it.

18:28.020 --> 18:29.230
No, even worse…

18:30.770 --> 18:32.480
I broke it myself.

18:38.000 --> 18:40.190
I'm such an idiot, huh.

18:41.050 --> 18:45.090
There'd probably be nothing left if not for you.

18:45.210 --> 18:46.140
No…

18:48.670 --> 18:50.280
Ume told me.

18:51.500 --> 18:53.390
Not to make you make that face.

18:56.030 --> 18:58.220
I didn't bother to look before,

19:04.300 --> 19:08.120
but I'm sure you've been making it
for a long time now.

19:13.850 --> 19:16.740
It's my fault, isn't it?

19:17.980 --> 19:21.800
But you still tried to keep us all connected.

19:22.690 --> 19:25.280
Thank you for protecting this.

19:32.250 --> 19:34.030
I'm sorry, Kame.

19:35.380 --> 19:36.700
It must have hurt.

19:37.460 --> 19:38.760
It must have been hard.

19:41.530 --> 19:42.780
I'm sorry.

19:43.380 --> 19:44.130
Sorry.

19:44.950 --> 19:46.260
I'm so sorry.

20:06.140 --> 20:07.730
Thank you, Kame.

20:08.540 --> 20:09.880
I'm okay now.

20:10.950 --> 20:14.990
I'll put an end to it. I can handle that much.

20:23.440 --> 20:24.330
Ume.

20:31.440 --> 20:33.250
You beat me.

20:34.560 --> 20:36.620
W-Wait! Tomiyama…

20:37.190 --> 20:39.530
So I'm leaving Lion's Head.

20:40.920 --> 20:43.320
Lion's Head is yours now.

20:45.280 --> 20:48.150
Please take care of everyone for me.

20:57.000 --> 20:58.530
What? I don't want it.

21:00.870 --> 21:03.910
You're the one who put our teams on the line here!

21:04.110 --> 21:06.730
I never wanted that to begin with!

21:06.950 --> 21:09.200
And I don't want my team any bigger.

21:09.530 --> 21:11.880
All that hierarchy stuff's so stifling!

21:12.360 --> 21:13.570
B-But…!

21:18.240 --> 21:19.230
How 'bout this?

21:19.550 --> 21:22.090
Starting today, we're all friends.

21:23.160 --> 21:26.140
I mean, hey, today's fight was, like,

21:26.280 --> 21:28.380
a get-together, or something?

21:29.010 --> 21:31.490
Thanks for comin', everyone!

21:31.880 --> 21:33.330
Did you all have fun?

21:34.130 --> 21:35.820
What's going on…?

21:36.050 --> 21:37.800
B-Beats me…

21:44.430 --> 21:46.880
You really are an interesting guy, Ume!

21:50.510 --> 21:52.970
Alright, that's it for today!

21:53.270 --> 21:55.470
Everybody head home!

21:57.000 --> 22:00.010
[#09: Umemiya's Style]

23:30.440 --> 23:34.410
So, what do you think is fun, Sakura?
Besides fighting.

23:34.570 --> 23:35.610
Besides fighting?

23:36.650 --> 23:38.020
Besides fighting…

23:39.210 --> 23:40.880
Hmm…

23:41.710 --> 23:43.750
Hmmmm…
